---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import data from '../../data/content.json';
export function getStaticPaths(){return data.cases.map(item=>({params:{slug:item.id},props:{item}}));}
interface Props {item:typeof data.cases[number]}
const {item}=Astro.props;
---
<Shell title={item.title}>
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← All investigations</a>
  <section class="intro"><div class="intro-top"><span class="eyebrow">Case {String(item.number).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="pill">{item.era}</span></div><h1 class="editorial">{item.title}</h1><p>{item.brief}</p></section>
  <noscript><div class="noscript">You can read the evidence cards and their sources below. Enable JavaScript to compare conclusions and save optional progress.</div></noscript>
  <div class="workspace" id="investigation" data-case={item.id}>
    <div><section class="panel panel-body"><div class="spread bottom-gap"><h2 class="case-section-title">The evidence board</h2><span class="micro" id="evidence-count" role="status">0 of 3 examined</span></div><div class="evidence-board">{item.evidence.map((card,index)=><details class="evidence-card" data-evidence={card.id}><summary><span class="evidence-number">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>{card.title}</span><span class="evidence-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="evidence-body"><span class="overline">Report summary</span><p>{card.text}</p><a href={card.source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="citation">{card.source.label} ↗</a></div></details>)}</div></section><section class="panel panel-body top-gap" id="conclusion-panel"><span class="eyebrow">What can we establish?</span><h2 class="case-section-title">Choose the supported conclusion.</h2><p class="micro">Examine at least two evidence cards, then compare the explanations.</p><div id="case-answers"></div><div class="actions top-gap"><button class="button" id="check-conclusion" disabled>Check my conclusion</button><button class="button ghost" id="case-hint">Show a hint</button></div><div id="case-feedback" aria-live="polite"></div></section></div>
    <aside class="sidebar sticky"><section class="panel panel-body"><span class="eyebrow">Case file</span><h2>{item.topic}</h2><p>Read the report. Notice what is stated. Be equally careful about what it does not establish.</p><div class="divider"></div><label class="check"><input id="remember" type="checkbox"/>Remember this case for up to 30 days</label><div class="divider"></div><button class="text-button" id="case-share">Copy case link</button><p class="micro top-gap"><button class="text-button" id="case-restart">Start this case again</button></p></section><section class="panel panel-body"><h2>Primary report</h2>{item.sources.map(source=><p><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="citation">{source.label} ↗</a></p>)}<p class="micro">Report summaries are original paraphrases. They are not translations or verbatim quotations.</p></section></aside>
  </div>
</Shell>
<script>import '../../lib/investigation';</script>
<style is:global>.case-section-title{font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.evidence-board{display:grid;gap:13px}.evidence-card{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.evidence-card[open]{border-color:var(--accent)}.evidence-card summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;cursor:pointer;padding:20px;list-style:none;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600}.evidence-card summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.evidence-number{color:var(--accent-ink);font-size:.68rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:7px;background:var(--surface-2)}.evidence-plus{font-size:1.25rem;margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}.evidence-card[open] .evidence-plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}.evidence-body{padding:0 20px 22px 65px}.evidence-body p{font-family:Newsreader,Georgia,serif;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.7;margin:12px 0}.case-choices{display:grid;gap:11px;margin-top:18px}.case-choice{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:16px;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.7;cursor:pointer}.case-choice:has(input:checked){background:var(--tint);border-color:var(--accent)}.case-choice input{accent-color:var(--accent);margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:580px){.evidence-card summary{padding:16px;gap:10px}.evidence-body{padding:0 17px 20px}.evidence-body p{font-size:1.1rem}}</style>
